Package: uzunyx-plasmatheme
Version: @VERSION@
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: emi <285864120+antarest47@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: plasma-workspace (>= 4:6.7)
Conflicts: waifbian-plasmatheme
Replaces: waifbian-plasmatheme
Recommends: uzunyx-wallpapers
Description: Uzunyx Plasma theme (Breeze with Unity-style task indicators)
 Plasma desktop theme that only overrides the task manager graphics and the
 panel background, and inherits everything else from Breeze and the active
 color scheme. Running
 apps get a dot under their icon instead of a line along the panel edge,
 the active task gets a rounded highlight in the colour scheme's highlight
 colour with a thin outline like the panel's, hovered tasks a rounded grey one, and apps with
 several grouped windows show a rounded dash instead of a "+" badge. The
 panel background gets a thin light outline along its rounded edge, like
 the uzunyx window outline. Its default wallpaper is
 Uzunyx 1 (package uzunyx-wallpapers).
